    # Software
    1. [ALFRED](alfred.html) is a Alignment Free Distance Estimator software for Phylogenetic Inference.  It is based on the metric of average common substring.
    2. [PSbEC](psbec.html) is a parallel spectrum based error correction software for reads from high-throughput sequencing machines.

